{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"06.01","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":66,"reply_count":43,"alternative_count":11,"total_audio_count":120,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"06.01.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"请问，去这里怎么走？","meaning_my":"တဆိတ်လောက်၊ ဒီနေရာကို ဘယ်လိုသွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"你要去哪儿？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ကို သွားချင်တာလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"不好意思，想问一下路。","meaning_my":"အားနာပါတယ်၊ လမ်းနည်းနည်း မေးချင်လို့ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"去地铁站往哪边走？","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာကို သွားဖို့ ဘယ်ဘက်ကို သွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"一直往前，第二个路口左转。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့တည့်တည့်သွားပြီး ဒုတိယလမ်းဆုံမှာ ဘယ်ဘက်ကွေ့ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"去医院要往哪边走？","meaning_my":"ဆေးရုံသွားဖို့ ဘယ်ဘက်ကို သွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"往前走五分钟，就在右边。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့တည့်တည့် ငါးမိနစ်လောက် သွားရင် ညာဘက်မှာ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"从这儿怎么去市场？","meaning_my":"ဒီကနေ ဈေးကို ဘယ်လိုသွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这附近有公交站吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီနားမှာ ဘတ်စ်ကားမှတ်တိုင် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，就在马路对面。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ လမ်းတစ်ဖက်ကမ်းမှာပဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"从哪个出口出去？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ထွက်ပေါက်ကနေ ထွက်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"从二号出口出去。","meaning_my":"နံပါတ်နှစ်ထွက်ပေါက်ကနေ ထွက်ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"要走几号出口？","meaning_my":"နံပါတ်ဘယ်လောက် ထွက်ပေါက်ကနေ ထွက်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"一直往前走吗？","meaning_my":"ရှေ့တည့်တည့်ပဲ ဆက်သွားရမှာလား။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，直走，到路口再左转。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ တည့်တည့်သွားပြီး လမ်းဆုံရောက်မှ ဘယ်ဘက်ကွေ့ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"一直直走吗？","meaning_my":"တည့်တည့်ပဲ ဆက်သွားရမှာလား။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S007_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"左转还是右转？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ဘက်ကွေ့ရမလား၊ ညာဘက်ကွေ့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"到前面的路口右转。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့က လမ်းဆုံရောက်ရင် ညာဘက်ကွေ့ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"前面这个路口要转吗？","meaning_my":"ရှေ့က ဒီလမ်းဆုံမှာ ကွေ့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"走到路口以后呢？","meaning_my":"လမ်းဆုံရောက်ပြီးရင် ဘယ်လိုဆက်သွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"过了路口就到了。","meaning_my":"လမ်းဆုံကျော်သွားရင် ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"从这里进去吗？","meaning_my"