018_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"坐十二路公交。","meaning_my":"နံပါတ်ဆယ့်နှစ် ဘတ်စ်ကား စီးပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S018_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"地铁坐几号线？","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထား လိုင်းနံပါတ်ဘယ်လောက် စီးရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S019_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"坐二号线。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထား လိုင်းနံပါတ်နှစ် စီးပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S019_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"在哪一站下车？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်မှတ်တိုင်မှာ ဆင်းရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.01-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"到人民广场站下车。","meaning_my":"ပြည်သူ့ရင်ပြင်ဘူတာမှာ ဆင်းပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.01-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"走过去远吗？","meaning_my":"လမ်းလျှောက်သွားရင် ဝေးလား။","audio_file":"06.01.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.02-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不远，走过去十分钟。","meaning_my":"မဝေးဘူး၊ လမ်းလျှောက် ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက်ပဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.02-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.02-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"走着去远不远？","meaning_my":"လမ်းလျှောက်သွားရင် ဝေးမဝေး။","audio_file":"06.01.02-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"走路要多久？","meaning_my":"လမ်းလျှောက်ရင် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.02-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"大概十五分钟。","meaning_my":"ဆယ့်ငါးမိနစ်လောက် ကြာမယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.02-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.02-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"步行大概要几分钟？","meaning_my":"လမ်းလျှောက်ရင် မိနစ်ဘယ်လောက်လောက် ကြာမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.02-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"坐车要多久？","meaning_my":"ကားစီးသွားရင် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာမလဲ။","audio_