_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我可能走错路了。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှားသွားမိတာ ဖြစ်နိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"我迷路了。","meaning_my":"လမ်းပျောက်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S003","kind":"main","cn":"我是不是走过头了？","meaning_my":"သွားရမယ့်နေရာကို ကျော်သွားပြီလား။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，你走过头了。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ သွားရမယ့်နေရာကို ကျော်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S004","kind":"main","cn":"我要往回走吗？","meaning_my":"နောက်ပြန်လှည့်သွားရမလား။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，往回走一点。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ နည်းနည်း နောက်ပြန်လှည့်သွားပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S004_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"要原路返回吗？","meaning_my":"လာတဲ့လမ်းအတိုင်း ပြန်သွားရမလား။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S004_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S005","kind":"main","cn":"导航好像不对。","meaning_my":"လမ်းညွှန်မြေပုံက မှားနေသလိုပဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先重新定位，再导航一次。","meaning_my":"တည်နေရာကို ပြန်စစ်ပြီး လမ်းကြောင်း ပြန်ရှာကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"导航显示的路走不通。","meaning_my":"မြေပုံညွှန်တဲ့လမ်းက သွားလို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那就换一条路吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို တခြားလမ်းကနေ သွားကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我看一下路线吗？","meaning_my":"လမ်းကြောင်းကို ကြည့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"把你的位置发来，我帮你看。","meaning_my":"ရောက်နေတဲ့တည်နေရာကို ပို့ပေးပါ၊ ကြည့်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"我现在应该往哪边走？","meaning_my":"အခု ဘယ်ဘက်ကို ဆက်သွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我好像走反了。","meaning_my":"လမ်းကြောင်းပြောင်းပြန် လျှောက်လာမိသလိုပဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，你走反方向了。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ လမ်းကြောင်း ပြောင်းပြန်သွားနေတယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S010","kind":"main","cn":"我重新定位一下。","meaning_my":"တည်နေရာကို ပြန်စစ်ကြည့်မယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S011","kind":"main","cn":"往回走多远？","meaning_my":"နောက်ပြန် ဘယ်လောက်ဝေးဝေး သွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"要绕一圈吗？","meaning_my":"ပတ်သွားရမှာလား။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S013","kind":"main","cn":"前面能掉头吗？","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ ကားပြန်ကွေ့လို့ရလား။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"前面有允许掉头的地方。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ ကားပြန်ကွေ့ခွင့်ရှိတဲ့နေရာ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"这条路是单行道吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီလမ်းက တစ်လမ်းသွားလား။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"这个出口封了。","meaning_my":"ဒီထွက်ပေါက် ပိတ်ထားတယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我走错出口了。","meaning_my":"ထွက်ပေါက် မှားထွက်မိသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"从下一个出口出去看看。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထွက်ပေါက်ကနေ ထွက်ကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S016_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我从错的出口出来了。","meaning_my":"ထွက်ပေါက်မှားကနေ ထွက်မိသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S016_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S017","kind":"main","cn":"我到你说的地方了，可没看到。","meaning_my":"ပြောတဲ့နေရာကို ရောက်ပြီ၊ ဒါပေမဲ့ မတွေ့ဘူး။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"你看看是不是在另一个门口。","meaning_my":"တခြားဝင်ပေါက်ဘက်မှာ ရောက်နေတာလား ကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.01.04-S018","kind":"main","cn":"我问问路人。","meaning_my":"လမ်းသွားလူတစ်ယောက်ကို မေးကြည့်မယ်။","audio_file":"06.01.04-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
